   "firstViewTextSample": "AI Video Agent\nCreate\nToolkit\nGallery\nResources\nCLI/MCP\nPricing\nGet Started\nPRODUCT HUNT\n#1  Product of the Day\nHi, I'm Pexo. The AI video agent that turns your ideas into videos.\n\nSimply talk to Pexo to create publish-ready videos instantly.\n\nTell Pexo what video you want to create\nAdd\nto create an explainer video with animated charts\n\nStart with a URL, PDF, image, video, audio, or your idea.\n\nCreate a mascot launch video\nCreate a launch video\nMake a collage-style explainer\nCreate an AI avatar video\nCreate a SaaS launch video\nMake a kinetic typography explainer\nCreate a brand launch video\nMake an educational explainer\nMake an infographic product animation\nMake an App demo\nExplain a service\nCreate social ads\nCreate a cinematic short film\nCreate a live-action instructional video\nMake an animation\nHow Pexo Delivers A Full Video\n\nPaste a URL, an image, an audio, or a reference, Pexo writes, creates, and delivers your video end-to-end.\n\nStart with an idea\nShare a link, image, audio clip, or reference, and tell Pexo what you want to create.\nPexo plans it all\nPexo works with you to develop the script, scenes, shots, and creative direction.\nChat to refine video\nMark what you want to fix and make changes through conversation, just like commenting in a Google Doc.\nGet a ready-to-post video\nPexo delivers a polished video complete with voiceover, music, motion graphics, and more.\n\nWHAT YOU CAN CREATE\n\nOne agent for every kind of video\nMG Explainer\nLaunch Videos\nStory & Films\nProduct Ads",
